From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 13:58:17 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 350/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0347 to 0349

1. Read the voice arm flag at the start of handleCreate so a voice-started chat keeps it and a failed create cannot leak it.
2. The paused and unavailable sheet and bar call onRestartMic (Listen again); the landing gets restart().
3. The sheet keeps the actions row visible; only the input area hides.
4. Turning Voice off calls the registered stop, which clears a refused reply.
5. The voice log goes before a draft that is a slash command.
6. A late NotAllowedError after stop() no longer marks playback blocked.
7. The landing reports listening when the mic was already listening.
8. Tests: the blocked mirror and chat switch in useAeSpeakReplies.
